# «а) все 33» — the fixed versions within the ranges of the modules that need them —
# and «а) 16 в той же мажорной ветке»; of the 16 in another major version 4, aZ
# 18.11.2026 15:26: «а) как в таблице» — the other 12 and the 2 with no fixed version
# are not here), then the modules their new versions need where the bundle has none in
# their range: under the module that needs them, as npm would put them. The files of a
# module replaced go, its node_modules stays.
